      "side": 1,
      "message": "\"--configure\" and \"--remove\" open a second SSH session: has_base_config() builds an SSHHelper (paramiko) while the pexpect session for the same switch is already open (roce.py:166-173). So it is two sessions per switch on those actions, one on the base-config actions. Reword, or check the base config over the existing session.",
      "revId": "d1c33de6b67e648f34a55e5316faa7ee8f7f8106",
      "serverId": "d5d70762-12d0-45a1-890d-524b12d3f735"
    },
